# CRDC Data Hub UI (crdc-datahub-ui) Reference

## Project Location

The crdc-datahub-ui frontend is a separate repo. Clone it to your preferred location (e.g. `../crdc-datahub-ui` as a sibling to crdc-dh-automation, or `~/crdc-frontend/crdc-datahub-ui`). Use it as a reference for UI structure, components, and DOM attributes when writing locators.

## Tech Stack
- **React 18** + **TypeScript 5.8**, **Vite 6** (port 3010)
- **MUI v5** + **Emotion** (styling), **Apollo Client 3.9** + **GraphQL** (data)
- **React Router v6** (lazy-loaded routes), **Redux** (Model Navigator only)
- **React Context** (15+ contexts: Auth, Form, Submission, Collaborators, etc.)
- **Zod 4** + **react-hook-form** (validation/forms)

## Routes
| Route | Content Area |
|-------|-------------|
| `/` | Home |
| `/login` | Login (NIH SSO) |
| `/submission-requests` | Questionnaire list |
| `/submission-request/:appId/:section?` | Questionnaire form (Sections A-D + Review) |
| `/data-submissions` | Data submissions list |
| `/data-submission/:submissionId/:tab?` | Single submission (tabs: upload-activity, validation-results, cross-validation-results, data-view) |
| `/data-explorer` | Data explorer |
| `/users/:userId?` | User management |
| `/profile/:userId?` | User profile |
| `/programs/:orgId?` | Organizations |
| `/studies/:studyId?` | Studies |
| `/institutions`, `/institution/:institutionId?` | Institutions |
| `/operation-dashboard` | Operation dashboard |
| `/release-notes` | Release notes |
| `/model-navigator/:model/:version?` | Data Model Navigator |

## Key Source Directories
- `src/components/` — 57+ component directories (~194 source files)
- `src/content/` — Page-level views (12 content areas)
- `src/graphql/` — 74 GraphQL operations
- `src/config/` — Auth, tables, data commons config
- `src/types/` — TypeScript type definitions
- `src/hooks/` — 9 custom hooks
- `src/utils/` — ~20 utility modules

## Authentication
- NIH SSO via OAuth code exchange
- `AuthContext` manages session; PBAC via `hasPermission(user, resource, action)`
- Roles: Admin, Federal Lead, DCP, Submitter, User

## DOM Attribute Strategy for Locators
1. **`data-testid`** — Most reliable (GenericTable, filters, dialogs, buttons)
2. **`id`** — NavBar items, form labels, questionnaire fields
3. **`aria-label` / `aria-labelledby`** — Accessible elements, form inputs
4. **Text content** — Buttons, tabs, links (fallback)
5. **MUI classes** — `Mui{Component}-root` patterns (last resort)

## AILocators Object Repository
All locators are in `Object Repository/CRDC/AILocators/` organized by page:
- `Global/` — Header, Footer, SystemUseWarning, InactivityDialog, Breadcrumbs
- `DataSubmissions/` — List, CreateDialog, Detail (Summary, Tabs, Validation, DataView, Actions, Dialogs)
- `SubmissionRequests/` — List, Form (Sections A-D, Review, Navigation), StatusBar, Dialogs
- `Users/`, `Organizations/`, `Studies/`, `Institutions/` — Admin pages
- `DataExplorer/`, `OperationDashboard/`, `ReleaseNotes/` — Read-only pages
- `AccessRequest/`, `APITokenDialog/`, `GenericTable/`, `DeleteDialog/` — Shared components
